  "solution": {
    "text": "$2 f(x)+3 f(-x)=15-4 x$...(1)\r\nReplace $x$ by $-x$\r\n$2 f(-x)+3 f(x)=15+4 x$ ...(2)\r\nAfter solving (1) and (2), we get\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\nf(x)=4 x+3 \\\\\r\n\\therefore f(2)=8+3=11\r\n\\end{array}$",
